    "description": "<p>Subsuming the smoldering resolve of her lineage into her spirit, a Dragon-Blood may become equally inviolable and implacable. She adds a bonus to her Dodge and Parry MDV equal to the Magnitude of the unit that would be formed by assembling all her living Dragon-Blooded descendents. This bonus does not apply against the social attacks of a direct ancestor. In addition, all descendents apply this same value as a penalty to their MDV when attempting to resist their ancestor's social attacks unless they also know this Charm.</p>",
